5cfe6cf6e0c","systemDataId":"1709749278020-JA5UVFP2VUNW9B75DLIF","systemDataVariants":"2000x3000,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w","systemDataSourceType":"PNG","filename":"mini .png","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"8f867d","topRightAverage":"b0aba8","bottomLeftAverage":"8c6a60","bottomRightAverage":"8d6951","centerAverage":"81c1bc","suggestedBgColor":"a5b3ad"},"urlId":"mini-mystery-bag","title":"Mini Mystery Bag","body":null,"excerpt":"<p><strong><span>Introducing our choose-your-budget Mini Mystery Bags! </span></strong><span>Try out the fun and adventure of Mystery Bags with a Mini bag tailored to your budget!</span></p><p><span>Our Mystery Bags have been a client favorite for years, and we're excited to make trying them out even friendlier on your budget! Want a sprinkle of fun for spring? Need a new work look? Or just in the mood for a sweet surprise? Let us put together a Mini Mystery Bag curated just for you!</span></p><p><span>Choose your budget: $30 - $60! You can expect 2-4 items depending on the budget you choose.</span></p><p><span>When you order, you'll answer some quick questions about your size + style, and our team will handpick goodies just for you.</span></p><p><br></p><p><u><span>Here are the details:</span></u><br>You can expect all types of clothing and possibly accessory items in your Mystery Bag. When you check out, you can also share items you\u2019d prefer to see or don\u2019t want in your bag. You\u2019ll also have an opportunity to share your shoe size if you\u2019re interested in shoes being included.&nbsp;</p><p><em>We\u2019ll do our best to include what you\u2019re looking for based on our current inventory. Please note that we\u2019ll do our best to avoid items you\u2019re not interested in but cannot guarantee every request.<br><br></em>Like everything you purchase online, Mystery Bags are available for in-store pick-up or shipping for $10. For pick up, please allow 72 hours before pick up. For shipped Mystery Bags, <em>it can take up to 2 weeks for Mystery Bags to ship. </em>All sales final with Mystery Bags.<br><br>The joy of Mystery Bags is truly the surprise we\u2019re packing up for you. <strong>If you\u2019re feeling unsure or the \u201Cmystery\u201D feels more stressful than fun, Mystery Bags probably aren\u2019t right for you.</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.cakeplussize.com/mystery-bags\"><strong><u><span>See other Mystery Bag options here!</span></u></strong></a></p>","likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/online/mini-mystery-bag","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/59b6ef82f7e0abd6682f5b79/1709749278020-JA5UVFP2VUNW9B75DLIF/mini+.png","contentType":"image/png","structuredContent":{"_type":"StoreItem","priceCents":0,"salePriceCents":0,"priceMoney":{"currency":"USD","value":"0.00"},"salePriceMoney":{"currency":"USD","value":"0.00"},"onSale":false,"productType":1,"additionalFieldsFormId":"5ffa070fde3f5f064f554c72","customAddButtonText":"Add To Cart","useCustomAddButtonText":false,"additionalFieldsForm":{"id":"5ffa070fde3f5f064f554c72","type":2,"name":"Mystery Bag Info ","fields":["{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"text-yui_3_17_2_1_1610220674129_44358\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"Please share 3-5 words that describe your style.\",\"description\":\"\",\"placeholder\":\"\",\"required\":true,\"text\":true}","{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"text-yui_3_17_2_1_1610220674129_43397\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"What size(s) do you wear? (It's most helpful to name brands and the sizes you wear in those brands.)\",\"description\":\"\",\"placeholder\":\"\",\"required\":true,\"text\":true}","{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"text-yui_3_17_2_1_1610220674129_45969\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"What would you love to see in your bag?\",\"description\":\"\",\"placeholder\":\"\",\"required\":false,\"text\":true}","{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"text-yui_3_17_2_1_1610220674129_47523\",\"lock